X-WR-CALNAME:Bakerloo disruption
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-11-21T04:30:00&endDate=2026-11-23T01:29:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nBAKERLOO LINE: Saturday 21 and Sunday 22 November\, no service between Queens Park and Harrow & Wealdstone. There will also be no LIONESS LINE service between Euston and Watford Junction. Special bus service 718 operates. LONDON NORTH WESTERN RAILWAY trains continue to stop at Harrow & Wealdstone. SOUTHERN trains stop at Wembley Central and Harrow & Wealdstone until 1900 only.
DTEND:20261123T012900Z
DTSTART:20261121T043000Z
SUMMARY:Bakerloo: Part Closure
UID:9eb6bd59-5925-4776-9654-1c45e0ce6e89@9eb6.org
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-12-06T04:30:00&endDate=2026-12-07T01:29:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nBAKERLOO LINE: Sunday 6 December\, no service between Queens Park and Harrow & Wealdstone. There will also be no LIONESS LINE service between Willesden Junction and Harrow & Wealdstone. Special bus service 718 operates. LONDON NORTH WESTERN RAILWAY trains continue to stop at Harrow & Wealdstone. SOUTHERN trains stop at Wembley Central and Harrow & Wealdstone between 1300 and 2000 only
